      "text": "Computational Phonology Research Group Linguistics Department , UC San Diego current schedule The Com putational Ph onolog y (ComPhy) Research Group is a forum for discussion of theoretical and computational phonology. You can find our current schedule of meetings here . Please join us! Current members: Eric Baković , Angie Lee, Eitan Price, Travis Putman",
